{"resource":{"id":"ml-learning-roadmap","title":"Machine Learning — Learning Roadmap","category":"AI & Data","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"7 min","pages":7,"lastUpdated":"June 2026","tags":["Machine Learning","ML","Python"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A structured 24-week Machine Learning roadmap — exactly what to study, in what order, with weekly milestones, projects, certifications, and readiness checkpoints."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"beginner","label":"1. Beginner Roadmap"},{"id":"python","label":"2. Python Foundations"},{"id":"math","label":"3. Mathematics for ML"},{"id":"data","label":"4. Data Analysis"},{"id":"algos","label":"5. ML Algorithms"},{"id":"eval","label":"6. Model Evaluation"},{"id":"deep","label":"7. Deep Learning Intro"},{"id":"projects","label":"8. Portfolio Projects"},{"id":"career","label":"9. Career Preparation"},{"id":"plan","label":"10. Final Learning Plan"},{"id":"checklists","label":"Roadmap Review"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"}],"related":[{"title":"Machine Learning — Frequently Asked Questions","tag":"AI & Data","time":"9 min"},{"title":"Machine Learning — Tips & Tricks","tag":"AI & Data","time":"11 min"},{"title":"Machine Learning — Beginner Guide","tag":"AI & Data","time":"12 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\"></p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">} title=\"What you'll take away\">\n          <ul class=\"mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n            <li>Follow a structured 24-week ML learning journey.</li>\n            <li>Build skills step-by-step with clear weekly milestones.</li>\n            <li>Track progress against measurable checkpoints.</li>\n            <li>Ship portfolio-ready projects at each stage.</li>\n            <li>Prepare confidently for ML interviews and roles.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div></div></div></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523240795612-9a054b0db644?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Beginner → Intermediate → Advanced learning path with skill tree and milestone projects.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"beginner\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Beginner Roadmap (Weeks 1–4)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Goal: comfort with Python, basic data handling, and one supervised learning demo.</p>\n        <Milestone week=\"Week 1\" title=\"Python essentials\" tasks={[\"Variables, control flow, functions\", \"Lists, dicts, comprehensions\", \"Files & error handling\"]} />\n        <Milestone week=\"Week 2\" title=\"Data toolkit\" tasks={[\"NumPy arrays & broadcasting\", \"Pandas Series/DataFrame basics\", \"Matplotlib line/bar/scatter\"]} />\n        <Milestone week=\"Week 3\" title=\"First ML model\" tasks={[\"Scikit-learn Iris classification\", \"Train/test split, accuracy\", \"Try Logistic Regression & KNN\"]} />\n        <Milestone week=\"Week 4\" title=\"Mini-project\" tasks={[\"Titanic survival prediction on Kaggle\", \"Write a README with results\", \"Publish notebook to GitHub\"]} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"python\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Python Foundations</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Master list/dict/set comprehensions and generators.</li>\n          <li>Learn <code>venv</code>/<code>uv</code>/<code>poetry</code> for reproducible envs.</li>\n          <li>Adopt <code>ruff</code> + <code>black</code> for formatting/linting.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code># Reusable train helper\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import cross_val_score\ndef cv_score(model, X, y, cv=5):\n    return cross_val_score(model, X, y, cv=cv, scoring=&quot;accuracy&quot;).mean()</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"math\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Mathematics for ML (Weeks 5–8)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Linear algebra:</strong> vectors, matrices, dot product, matrix inverse.</li>\n          <li><strong>Calculus:</strong> derivatives, gradients, chain rule (enough for gradient descent).</li>\n          <li><strong>Probability &amp; statistics:</strong> distributions, Bayes' theorem, expectation, variance.</li>\n          <li><strong>Optimisation:</strong> convex vs non-convex, learning rate intuition.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"data\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Data Analysis (Weeks 9–10)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Exploratory Data Analysis: distributions, correlations, missingness.</li>\n          <li>Data cleaning: null handling, outliers, type conversions.</li>\n          <li>SQL basics — SELECT/JOIN/GROUP BY — most jobs still expect it.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"algos\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. ML Algorithms (Weeks 11–14)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Linear/Logistic Regression, Decision Trees, Random Forest, Gradient Boosting.</li>\n          <li>K-Means, PCA, DBSCAN for unsupervised learning.</li>\n          <li>Understand when to pick each — no free lunch.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border/60\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-left text-sm\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-secondary/60\"><tr><th class=\"p-2\">Stage</th><th class=\"p-2\">Focus</th><th class=\"p-2\">Deliverable</th></tr></thead>\n            <tbody class=\"[&_tr]:border-t [&_tr]:border-border/60\">\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">Beginner</td><td class=\"p-2\">Supervised basics</td><td class=\"p-2\">Titanic + Housing notebooks</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">Intermediate</td><td class=\"p-2\">Ensembles + tuning</td><td class=\"p-2\">Kaggle silver submission</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">Advanced</td><td class=\"p-2\">Deep learning + MLOps</td><td class=\"p-2\">Deployed live app</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"eval\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Model Evaluation (Weeks 15–16)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Cross-validation, confusion matrix, ROC-AUC, PR-AUC.</li>\n          <li>Bias–variance analysis — learning curves.</li>\n          <li>Slice-based evaluation for fairness.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"deep\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Deep Learning Introduction (Weeks 17–20)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Neural network basics with PyTorch or Keras.</li>\n          <li>CNNs for images, RNN/Transformer intuition for sequences.</li>\n          <li>Transfer learning — fine-tune a pre-trained model on your data.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"projects\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Portfolio Projects (Weeks 21–22)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>End-to-end: dataset → model → FastAPI → Streamlit UI → deployed on Render/Fly.</li>\n          <li>Pick a domain: healthcare, finance, retail, sport, education.</li>\n          <li>Include monitoring + a README that reads like a case study.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Recommended courses &amp; certifications</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          Andrew Ng — Machine Learning Specialization (Coursera) · DeepLearning.AI — Deep Learning Specialization · Kaggle Learn micro-courses ·\n          Google Cloud ML Engineer · AWS Machine Learning Specialty.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"career\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Career Preparation (Weeks 23–24)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Polish LinkedIn + GitHub — pin your top 3 projects.</li>\n          <li>Practice ML system design and 50 core interview questions.</li>\n          <li>Mock interviews weekly; track answers you missed.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"plan\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Final Learning Plan</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Daily:</strong> 60 min coding + 20 min reading.</li>\n          <li><strong>Weekly:</strong> one Kaggle notebook / mini-project.</li>\n          <li><strong>Monthly:</strong> one polished portfolio artefact + retrospective.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"checklists\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Roadmap Review — Checklists</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Beginner Checklist</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Comfortable with Python, NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib.</li>\n          <li>Trained &amp; evaluated at least 3 Scikit-learn models.</li>\n          <li>Published 2 notebooks to GitHub with clear READMEs.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Intermediate Checklist</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Tuned XGBoost / LightGBM to top-25% Kaggle score.</li>\n          <li>Wrote unit tests for feature pipelines.</li>\n          <li>Deployed one model behind FastAPI.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Advanced Learning Goals</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Fine-tuned a transformer for a real dataset.</li>\n          <li>Shipped a monitored production model with rollback.</li>\n          <li>Contributed to an open-source ML library.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Final Success Plan</h3>\n        <p>Ship one live app. Write one detailed case study. Complete 50 interview questions with confidence ≥ 4/5.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Consistency beats intensity — a steady 24 weeks outperforms bursts.</li>\n          <li>Projects &gt; certificates. Ship things that others can use.</li>\n          <li>Fundamentals compound — invest in maths &amp; evaluation early.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I skip the maths?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Not entirely — invest a light 4-week pass and revisit as you meet each topic.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How many projects for a portfolio?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Three great ones beat ten mediocre ones. Include one end-to-end deployed project.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Which certification is best?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Andrew Ng's Coursera specialisation for fundamentals; a cloud ML cert (GCP/AWS) for jobs.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Roadmap</strong> — a sequenced learning plan with milestones.</li>\n          <li><strong>Milestone</strong> — a measurable checkpoint.</li>\n          <li><strong>Portfolio</strong> — a public collection of your work.</li>\n          <li><strong>Kaggle</strong> — an online competition &amp; dataset platform.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>"}